Creating images with quotes has become easier. With the Quotes Creator, you can add quotes to your images and share them on social media.

The Quotes Creator is the best way to create and find quotes for status updates. The app offers options to choose photos from your gallery as backgrounds, text alignment, toggle between light and dark mode, change fonts, and much more...

The app gathers hundreds of quotes for you to share on WhatsApp status, Facebook, Instagram, or any other social network.

SOME OF THE FEATURES
- Create beautiful images with phrases;
- Share your phrases;
- Thousands of ready-made phrases;
- 4 styles of phrases to choose from;

THOUSANDS OF QUOTES
You have over 5,000 messages available to create your images. The phrases are divided into more than 20 categories, including motivational quotes, love, life, and much more.

Impress and motivate your followers with incredible quotes!
